 106 000021  6007          CAF                     /POWER CLEAR IS GOOD ENOUGH TO CLEAR AC
 107 000022  1025          TAD     BTUNIT          /GET BOOTSTRAP VALUE
 108 000023  6707          DSIM                    /START IT UP
