 117               
 118 000400  6007  EXTRNBU,CAF                     /POWER CLEAR IS GOOD ENOUGH TO CLEAR AC
 119 000401  1214          TAD     EXTUNIT         /GET BOOTSTRAP VALUE
 120 000402  6707          DSIM                    /START IT UP
 121 000403  2201          ISZ     .-2             /WAIT FOR
 122 000404  5203          JMP     .-1             /AWHILE
 123 000405  6706          DSRS                    /GET STATUS NOW
 124 000406  7510          SPA                     /SKIP IF NOT BUSY
 125 000407  5205          JMP     .-2             /ELSE WAIT FOR IT
 126 000410  7440          SZA                     /SKIP IF OK
 127 000411  7402          HLT                     /ELSE COMPLAIN
 128 000412  1214          TAD     EXTUNIT         /GET UNIT BITS AGAIN
 129 000413  5025          JMP     SEXTBUT&177     /CONTINUE THERE
 130               
 131 000414  1001  EXTUNIT,1001                    /BOOTSTRAP VALUE; 1401 FOR UNIT 3
