 451               
 452 007735* 4240  SBOOT2, JMS     SYSIO           /CALL I/O ROUTINES
 453 007736* 0000          0000                    /TRANSFER TO 00000
 454 007737* 1700  SBTFN2, 17^100+.-.              /BOOTSTRAP UNIT WILL BE FILLED IN
 455 007740* 0001          1                       /STARTING AT BLOCK 0001
 456 007741* 5742          JMP I   .+1/(MONSTRT)   /GO START IT UP
 457 007742* 0353          MONSTRT                 /THROUGH HERE
 458               
 459 007743* 7744  STABLE, TABLE                   /COMMAND TABLE POINTER
